"Delete and start over":"Supprimer et recommencer",
"Deliver Carnaval in full":"Assurer tout le Carnaval",
"Deliver at least 95% of what your customers want.":"Livre au moins 95 % de ce que veulent tes clients.",
"Delivered fresh every morning.":"Livré tout chaud chaque matin.",
"Delivered, 30 days":"Livré, 30 jours",
"Delivery: 2 to 6 weeks":"Livraison : 2 à 6 semaines",
